+### Storage usage
+
+`Account#bytes_used` and `Board#bytes_used` report how much storage is taken up by card images and
+by the files embedded in board descriptions, card descriptions, and comments.
+
+Totals are cached per board in `boards.bytes_used` and recalculated in the background
+(`Board::RecalculateBytesUsedJob`) whenever attachments come or go, when a card changes boards, or
+when a card is destroyed. Accounts add up the totals of their boards. Boards that haven't been
+calculated yet add up on the fly and schedule a calculation, so the numbers are never stale.
+
 ### UUID Primary Keys
 
 All tables use UUIDs (UUIDv7 format, base36-encoded as 25-char strings):
